    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Life \u2013 Clubbing in the Metaverse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate nightlife experience with Night Life \u2013 Clubbing in the Metaverse! Play in first-person or third-person using your keyboard, mouse, or gamepad. Customize your avatar, chill in your private home, or dive into vibrant nightclubs where music, lights, and fun await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Features:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Private Home Hub:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in your own personal space. Create your avatar, stream online radio, or relax and watch shows on your virtual TV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic Nightclub Experiences:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access a bustling nightclub with live DJ performances, stunning visuals, DJ lighting, and interactive mini-games. Dance, chat, and connect with other partygoers in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375800/extras/b45ff365ebbb5c7af7c612ffbc3fe400.poster.avif?t=1750641824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375800/extras/b45ff365ebbb5c7af7c612ffbc3fe400.webm?t=1750641824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375800/extras/b45ff365ebbb5c7af7c612ffbc3fe400.mp4?t=1750641824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Live DJ Events:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join scheduled events featuring live sets from talented DJs for an unforgettable night out in the metaverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking to relax at home, meet new people, or light up the dancefloor, Night Life \u2013 Clubbing in the Metaverse offers a unique and immersive clubbing experience\u2014anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
